    <sys:String x:Key="LOCImageRotaterRepairAllVideosQuestion" xml:space="preserve">Check every video in your ImageRotater library and repair the broken ones?

Videos downloaded in a fragmented format show as solid black tiles even though nothing reports an error. The repair rewrites only the container - a stream copy, so no quality is lost and healthy videos are left untouched.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCImageRotaterConvertJpegsQuestion" xml:space="preserve">Convert every JPEG in your ImageRotater library to PNG?

PNG is lossless, so no further quality is lost each time an image is processed - but the files get considerably larger. Quality already lost to JPEG cannot be recovered. Each JPEG is removed only once its PNG exists.</sys:String>
